Retrieve the driver’s copy of the  logical  configuration  table.
This  copy  of  the LCT matches the current device configuration,
but is not necessarily the latest available version of  the  LCT.
Request  that  the driver scan all bus ports, retrieve the latest
version of the LCT, and attach or detach  devices  as  necessary.
Note  that  higher‐level reconfiguration tasks (such as logically
re‐scanning SCSI busses) will not be  performed  by  this  ioctl.
